      {
       "text": "Almamlaka TV Digital Expansion Initiative",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 107.6,
       "y": 708.4,
       "h": 20,
       "font": "g_d0_f2",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Project Overview Document",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 672.4,
       "h": 14,
       "font": "g_d0_f2",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Introduction",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 618.4,
       "h": 18,
       "font": "g_d0_f2",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Almamlaka TV is launching a new initiative called the Digital Expansion Initiative (DEI), aimed at",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 595.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "modernizing the channel's digital presence across streaming, mobile, and social platforms. This",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 580.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "document outlines the project's scope, goals, and key stakeholders.",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 565.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Project Goals",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 529.4,
       "h": 18,
       "font": "g_d0_f2",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "The primary goal of the DEI is to increase digital viewership by 40% within the first year of launch.",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 506.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Secondary goals include improving content discoverability, modernizing the mobile application,",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 491.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "and establishing a unified content management system across all platforms.",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 476.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Key Details",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 440.4,
       "h": 18,
       "font": "g_d0_f2",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Project Lead: Sara Al-Rashid",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 417.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Total Approved Budget: $2,400,000",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 394.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Planned Launch Date: March 15, 2027",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 371.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Project Duration: 14 months",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 348.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "page": 2,
     "width": 612,
     "height": 792,
     "lines": [
      {
       "text": "4. Platform Scope",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 710.4,
       "h": 18,
       "font": "g_d0_f2",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "The initiative covers three main platforms: the Almamlaka TV mobile application (iOS and",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 687.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Android), the web streaming portal, and integration with third-party smart TV platforms. Each",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 672.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "platform will receive a redesigned user interface aligned with the updated Almamlaka TV brand",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 657.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "guidelines.",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 642.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "As part of the accessibility improvements, the mobile application will support content and subtitles",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 619.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "in 12 languages, including Arabic, English, French, and Spanish, with plans to expand to",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 604.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "additional languages in future phases.",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 589.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Stakeholders",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 553.4,
       "h": 18,
       "font": "g_d0_f2",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "The project is sponsored by the Almamlaka TV Digital Strategy Department and overseen by a",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 530.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "steering committee consisting of representatives from Engineering, Content, Marketing, and Legal",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 515.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "& Compliance.",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 500.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Success Metrics",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 464.4,
       "h": 18,
       "font": "g_d0_f2",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "Success will be measured through monthly active users (MAU), average session duration, app",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 441.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "store ratings, and content engagement rates. A quarterly review will be conducted by the steering",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 426.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "text": "committee to track progress against these metrics.",
       "cells": null,
       "x": 78,
       "y": 411.9,
       "h": 10.5,
       "font": "g_d0_f1",
       "dir": "ltr"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
